    "translation": "Opening words serve as the poem identifier. Historical Bahrain association; modern national borders did not exist. No cleared English translation supplied. Passage update (29 October 2026): Fresh English translation by ChatGPT; editorial draft, not a quoted published translation. Original and English contain the same selection. Specified romantic episode, rather than landscape opening. Source line divisions retained, including the split definite article in bayt 18. Diacritics and elongation omitted. Harut is associated with magic. Classical expressions بانية الأعطاف and ألحاظ الجنبيات translated provisionally; specialist review recommended.",
