    "description": "Only those who love can hear and understand the stars.",
    "provenance": "Poesias: edição definitiva, 2nd ed.; H. Garnier, Rio de Janeiro, 1902; USP library record",
    "location": "Via Láctea, sonnet XIII, complete 14-line sonnet.",
    "translation": "Rights evidence is the 1902 edition record. Linked Wikisource transcription may include CC BY-SA site material; retain attribution/source where applicable. Modern translations are separate. Passage update (29 October 2026): Fresh English translation by ChatGPT; editorial draft, not a quoted published translation. Original and English contain the same selection. Complete historical sonnet. Verse lines restored from webpage blank spacing; quotation spacing regularized. Amai is the imperative Love. No existing published English translation is reproduced.",
