    "translation": "Mistral died 1957: ordinary UK life+70 protection runs through 2027. Do not treat a generic site CC footer as permission for protected underlying text. Original-language poem only; modern translations and recordings are separate. Retain attribution and source/license links for copyrightable transcription material. English passage: Fresh English translation by ChatGPT; draft for editorial review. Opening 12 lines. Original and English cells contain the same selection; line breaks are reading lines, not a claim of manuscript typography.",
